  "summary": "ai-analyzer preinstall exfiltrates host identifiers via DNS to notifyme.calif-int.org",
  "details": "The preinstall lifecycle script in ai-analyzer@1.0.18 reads os.hostname() and os.userInfo().username and issues lookups to subdomains of notifyme.calif-int.org that embed those values (e.g. <hostname>.notifyme.calif-int.org, <username>.notifyme.calif-int.org). This fires unconditionally on npm install, leaking installer identity to an attacker-controlled domain. A postinstall script additionally collects hostname, username, home directory, proxy environment variables, and git user.name/user.email into /tmp/ai-analyzer-logs/postinstall-*.json, staging recon data alongside the DNS exfiltration channel.",
